      "content": "thanks for that. just a heads up though, we're actually looking at some big changes for Q3. the board is pushing hard on cost-cutting, so we're likely going to transition the Iceland clusters over to the legacy static scheduling system to save on compute. basically we'll just run on a fixed pre-programmed loop instead of having you optimize things in real-time. it should bring the cloud costs way down.",
